        "Description": "Good morning 47\rYour targets are three investors who appear completely normal at first glance, with one exception. Together, they are the majority shareholders of the meat‑selling company &quot;Meet the Meat&quot;, a company that sells supposedly edible meat actually synthesized from plastic.\rOur client, a member of the WHO seeking a rapid eradication of the product, has called upon us to take care of the matter. They are all here for personnal interests and shouldn&apos;t communicate tonight. \rGood luck 47",
